# Vendored ruviform ui/* TS sources — regenerated by tools/sync-ruviform-ui.mjs
# at the Cargo.lock rev, but copied so worktree agents skip the restore step.
# The copy preserves whatever rev the source workspace last synced: after a
# ruviform pin bump (Cargo.lock rev change) or branch switch it can be stale,
# and `mise run check-ruviform-rev` fails closed until `mise run sync-ui-deps`
# re-materializes it at the lock rev (synvelis#230).
ui/vendor/

# Built frontend bundle — regenerated by `mise run build-ui`; copied so a new
# worktree can `cargo run --features webview` without the node toolchain step
crates/synvelis-app/frontend/dist/

# Do not copy .mise/: tracked .mise/locks/ sidecars arrive with Git; other
